### Create a customer or delivery agent
POST http://localhost:8081/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Customer 1",
  "email": "customer1@example.com"
}

### Get a user by id
GET http://localhost:8081/users/3

### Create an agent used by delivery-service
POST http://localhost:8081/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Agent One",
  "email": "agent1@example.com",
  "role": "AGENT",
  "available": true
}

### Get the agent by id
GET http://localhost:8081/users/4

### List available agents
GET http://localhost:8081/users/agents/available

### Mark an agent unavailable
PATCH http://localhost:8081/users/4/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": true
}

### Get the same user through API Gateway discovery routing
GET http://localhost:8080/USER-SERVICE/users/1